    "detailed_description": "<h1>OUR SERVER IN DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/24dbd374bd02a7fec0b520c657b9e840.poster.avif?t=1733437402\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/24dbd374bd02a7fec0b520c657b9e840.webm?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>Roadmap</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/4a757140cf609a4d32e1e6b7e51213d0.avif?t=1733437402\" width=600 height=1500 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Welcome to the immersive world of &quot;XWarShooterVR&quot; a VR shooter where the combination of devastating guns, epic technomagic skills, and base-building strategy delivers an immersive gaming experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/0f9a352919173faf0352ecf4250075f6.poster.avif?t=1733437402\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/0f9a352919173faf0352ecf4250075f6.webm?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/0f9a352919173faf0352ecf4250075f6.mp4?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>GAME FEATURES:<br><br>TRAINING:<br>Improve your warriors in martial arts, choose from over 75 characters, each with a unique set of skills. Develop their abilities, upgrade a variety of weapons with different ranges and power. Emphasize the singularity of each hero, shaping their unique style of fighting on the battlefield.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/f75cc2f5ea0fc43711a635001e52e8d4.poster.avif?t=1733437402\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/f75cc2f5ea0fc43711a635001e52e8d4.webm?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/f75cc2f5ea0fc43711a635001e52e8d4.mp4?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>WIN HOWEVER YOU WANT:<br>Are you a team player or do you prefer solo attacks? Protect allies from enemies or rain meteorites down on your opponents' heads - choose your path to victory. With countless combinations of military arsenal, technomagic skills and a variety of heroes, you choose your play style.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/22336f44f1188a4036add6f4611bb831.poster.avif?t=1733437402\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/22336f44f1188a4036add6f4611bb831.webm?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/22336f44f1188a4036add6f4611bb831.mp4?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>EQUIPMENT:<br>Each hero is armed with three weapons and boosters. Assemble your deadly combination, boost your power and dominate the battlefield. Become a strategist and weapon master to surpass your opponents.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/d840a4e09c687c4a724554fa7571ff82.poster.avif?t=1733437402\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/d840a4e09c687c4a724554fa7571ff82.webm?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/d840a4e09c687c4a724554fa7571ff82.mp4?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>BUILD:<br>Build your base, collect resources and boosters to stay one step ahead of the enemy not only in battles but also in building a strong and impregnable base. Take your tactical skills to the next level.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/38d8e4dd3dfcfaa13698daaa2e87b031.poster.avif?t=1733437402\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/38d8e4dd3dfcfaa13698daaa2e87b031.webm?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/38d8e4dd3dfcfaa13698daaa2e87b031.mp4?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>COMPETE:<br>Take on the challenge and prove your skills in a unique blend of shooter and strategy. Team up with your battle buddies, socialize and compete in exciting battles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/5e41389850b765c31d1632f2000bebea.poster.avif?t=1733437402\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/5e41389850b765c31d1632f2000bebea.webm?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/5e41389850b765c31d1632f2000bebea.mp4?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>Hone your combat and base-building skills, because in &quot;XWarShooterVR&quot; you will not only have to fight your opponents on the battlefield, but also attack other people's bases, create and defend your own fortifications.<br>Join &quot;XWarShooterVR&quot; and become a legend in this exciting VR world!",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to the immersive world of &quot;XWarShooterVR&quot; a VR shooter where the combination of devastating guns, epic technomagic skills, and base-building strategy delivers an immersive gaming experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/0f9a352919173faf0352ecf4250075f6.poster.avif?t=1733437402\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/0f9a352919173faf0352ecf4250075f6.webm?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/0f9a352919173faf0352ecf4250075f6.mp4?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>GAME FEATURES:<br><br>TRAINING:<br>Improve your warriors in martial arts, choose from over 75 characters, each with a unique set of skills. Develop their abilities, upgrade a variety of weapons with different ranges and power. Emphasize the singularity of each hero, shaping their unique style of fighting on the battlefield.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/f75cc2f5ea0fc43711a635001e52e8d4.poster.avif?t=1733437402\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/f75cc2f5ea0fc43711a635001e52e8d4.webm?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/f75cc2f5ea0fc43711a635001e52e8d4.mp4?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>WIN HOWEVER YOU WANT:<br>Are you a team player or do you prefer solo attacks? Protect allies from enemies or rain meteorites down on your opponents' heads - choose your path to victo