13698daaa2e87b031.poster.avif?t=1733437402\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/38d8e4dd3dfcfaa13698daaa2e87b031.webm?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/38d8e4dd3dfcfaa13698daaa2e87b031.mp4?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>COMPETE:<br>Take on the challenge and prove your skills in a unique blend of shooter and strategy. Team up with your battle buddies, socialize and compete in exciting battles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/5e41389850b765c31d1632f2000bebea.poster.avif?t=1733437402\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/5e41389850b765c31d1632f2000bebea.webm?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756410/extras/5e41389850b765c31d1632f2000bebea.mp4?t=1733437402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>Hone your combat and base-building skills, because in &quot;XWarShooterVR&quot; you will not only have to fight your opponents on the battlefield, but also attack other people's bases, create and defend your own fortifications.<br>Join &quot;XWarShooterVR&quot; and become a legend in this exciting VR world!",
