    "pc_requirements": {
        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590/AMD FX 8350 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970, AMD Radeon R9 290 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR, currently has been tested only for Meta Quest 2,3<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Use the left hand controller for orientation and move. Please note that pointer for the left controller is not shown to simplify the process of selection the Ui elements by the right hand controller. Game has been tested in Meta Quest 2,3 VR headsets. If you are using another headsets and found problems please contact us in Discord. We will try to solve them in future production releases.</li></ul>"
